  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Using Doppler effect, apparent frequency is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8723;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>,&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>actual&#160;frequency</mtext><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>velocity&#160;of&#160;observer&#160;and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>velocity&#160;of&#160;source</mtext></math></p><p>For train&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;leaving the station,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>275</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For train&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;reaching the station,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>30</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>330</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p><p>The&nbsp;difference of frequencies heard by the person<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>275</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p>",
